E=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1482681?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800","html_url":"https://github.com/van800","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T07:15:09Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T07:15:09Z","body":"Reproduces for both Rider and VSCode. I tried on Mac OS X.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776534065/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777245501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115188#issuecomment-3777245501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115188","id":3777245501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hJDE9","user":{"login":"van800","id":1482681,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODI2ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1482681?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800","html_url":"https://github.com/van800","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T10:09:45Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T10:10:46Z","body":"For me there is output of Godot:\n```\nERROR: Bug: Dictionary::operator[] used when there was no value for the given key \"checksums\". Please report.\n   at: operator[] (core/variant/dictionary.cpp:136)\n\n```\n\nIt seems the missing \"checksums\" in this code.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3f99bef808d32ebbbb5544e1f2e3d85d796bcd70/editor/debugger/debug_adapter/debug_adapter_types.h#L86-L96\ntried my best, but don't understand what happens.\n@rsubtil ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777245501/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777352820","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115188#issuecomment-3777352820","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115188","id":3777352820,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hJdR0","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T10:31:43Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T10:31:43Z","body":"Seems to be a side-effect of changes to Dictionary's `operator[]` with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/0be2a77156b62fab044da64687d9d0b456f47bbe. Curiously, **LSP** was also affected by this and switched to the safe `get` access with default values (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111684/changes), so I'll change these direct dictionary access to the safer variant.\n\nI'll still test as to why DAP clients seem to suddenly close the connection when this happens, but my suspicion is that these internal changes now return empty objects, which may be invalid in the DAP flow, and hence why clients terminate the connection.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777352820/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777621209","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115188#issuecomment-3777621209","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115188","id":3777621209,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hKezZ","user":{"login":"van800","id":1482681,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODI2ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1482681?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800","html_url":"https://github.com/van800","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T11:37:13Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T11:37:13Z","body":"cc: @Ivorforce ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777621209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777684098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115188#issuecomment-3777684098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115188","id":3777684098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hKuKC","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T11:52:23Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T12:39:46Z","body":"I'm not sure this change is related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/0be2a77156b62fab044da64687d9d0b456f47bbe / #106636.\n\nTo explain what's happening: The dictionary provided to `from_json` is missing a `\"checksum\"` key.\nIn previous versions of Godot, it inserted a type fitting value (by default: `Variant::NIL`) into the dictionary at this key (even though it was passed as `const`), and returned `Variant::NIL`. In the new version of Godot, it prints an error, and returns `Variant::NIL`.\n\nSo there might be one of 3 things happening:\n\n- The dictionary is typed, and the `Variant::NIL` return value of 4.6 does not match the dictionary's value type.\n- The caller of `from_json` currently expects `\"checksum\"` to be inserted automatically (in which case the caller is at fault).\n- The error here is unrelated to Rider failing to debug.\n\nIt should be possible to test this theory by changing the code as such, restoring previous behavior:\n\n```cpp\n// previous: _checksums = p_params[\"checksums\"];\n_checksums = ((Dictionary &)p_params)[\"checksums\"];\n```\n\n(note that this should not be a long-term solution, as const-casting is generally bad, but it may help identify if the change is involved with the issue)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777684098/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777725061","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115188#issuecomment-3777725061","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115188","id":3777725061,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hK4KF","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T12:02:43Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T12:02:43Z","body":"To second @Ivorforce's comment, I tested DAP on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/0be2a77156b62fab044da64687d9d0b456f47bbe and indeed it did not prevent debugging from working. I'm currently bisecting what might be the cause of Godot terminating the debugged process.\n\nThis lack of input validation still needs to be addressed, but indeed it doesn't seem to be the culprit here.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777725061/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777916489","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115188#issuecomment-3777916489","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115188","id":3777916489,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hLm5J","user":{"login":"AlanDavison","id":69521518,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTIxNTE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69521518?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlanDavison","html_url":"https://github.com/AlanDavison","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlanDavison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlanDavison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlanDavison/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlanDavison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlanDavison/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlanDavison/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlanDavison/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlanDavison/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlanDavison/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T12:38:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T12:38:21Z","body":"> For me there is output of Godot:\n> \n> ```\n> ERROR: Bug: Dictionary::operator[] used when there was no value for the given key \"checksums\". Please report.\n>    at: operator[] (core/variant/dictionary.cpp:136)\n> ```\n\nInteresting. I *did* get that output with a more basic character controller script, but it went away completely when I switched to what's in the repro project, so I put it aside thinking it was unrelated.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777916489/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777991797","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115188#issuecomment-3777991797","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115188","id":3777991797,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hL5R1","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T12:53:23Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T12:53:23Z","body":"Yup, the `Dictionary::operator[]` message was a red herring.\n\nBisected to d1a5d9da3e8bd32adf6fbcb8f7734bcedf70176f (#114457). Now that the script debugger always `_stop_and_notify`'es, DAP receives the `stopped` signal whenever a debug session is initialized and informs DAP clients that the debugged process has terminated, hence why clients then immediately close.\ncc @kbieganski\n\n@Ivorforce if it's OK with you, I'd open another issue regarding the input validation topic to separate from this one, which isn't as prioritary","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777991797/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3778322544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115188#issuecomment-3778322544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115188","id":3778322544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hNKBw","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T14:08:45Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T14:08:45Z","body":"> Bisected to [d1a5d9d](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/d1a5d9da3e8bd32adf6fbcb8f7734bcedf70176f) ([#114457](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114457)). Now that the script debugger always `_stop_and_notify`'es, DAP receives the `stopped` signal whenever a debug session is initialized and informs DAP clients that the debugged process has terminated, hence why clients then immediately close.\n\nGiven that we're at RC2 and the stable release is imminent, the best course of action is probably to revert #114457 for 4.6, unless you can think of an easy fix that preserves the fix for the issues it was aiming to address.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3778322544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3778411873","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115188#issuecomment-3778411873","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115188","id":3778411873,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hNf1h","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T14:26:02Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T14:26:02Z","body":"> Given that we're at RC2 and the stable release is imminent, the best course of action is probably to revert https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114457 for 4.6, unless you can think of an easy fix that preserves the fix for the issues it was aiming to address.\n\nYeah, I was trying to find some usable solution for now, but so far they're all quite hacky. When `stopped` is emitted, `ScriptEditorDebugger` already cleaned up the peer connection, so I can't use `is_session_active()` from DAP since it's too late. The only hack I have working so far is to store the state of `is_session_active()` before `ScriptEditorDebugger` stops the connection, and emit it alongside `stopped` signal so I can use it from DAP. So, not a great solution 😔 ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3778411873/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]